"description":"Guess Me is a face guessing game built for two players on iPhone.\n\nEach of you picks a secret character from a board of 24. Take turns asking yes or no questions, flip down the faces that don't match, and call the name when you're sure. Guess right and you win the round.\n\nTwo ways to play:\n\nPass and play. Share one phone and hand it back and forth. Perfect for the couch, the car, or a cafe table.\n\nOnline. Start a room and share the code, or let your friend scan the QR code, and play from anywhere.\n\nTwenty character sets are built in: Classic, Animals, Monsters, Pirates, Fairy Tales, Wild West, Dinosaurs, Circus, Halloween, Space, Robots, Superheroes, Christmas, Knights & Castles, Vikings, Ninjas & Samurai, Jobs, Food Friends, Dogs, and Mythology. You can also build custom sets from names you type in yourself, and add a photo to each one, so the board can be your friends, your family, or your whole group chat. Your sets work in both modes: pick one for pass and play, or bring it to an online room and your friend gets the same board, photos and all.\n\nNo account and no login. Open the app and play.\n\nQuestions or ideas? Email admin@zinance.app.\n\nPremium unlocks Pirates, Fairy Tales, Wild West, Dinosaurs, Circus, Halloween, Space, Robots, Superheroes, Christmas, Knights & Castles, Vikings, Ninjas & Samurai, Jobs, Food Friends, Dogs and Mythology. Classic, Animals, Monsters and your own custom sets are free. Premium is an auto-renewing weekly or yearly subscription, or a one-time lifetime purchase. Payment is charged to your Apple ID, and a subscription renews automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it anytime in your App Store account settings.\n\nPrivacy policy: https://zinance.app/privacy\nTerms of use: https://zinance.app/terms", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.76471000000000000085265128291212022304534912109375, "fileSizeBytes":"124252160", "formattedPrice":"Free", "u