"description":"Headbands is the charades party game that turns any get-together into a comedy show. Hold the phone to your forehead and guess the word.\n\nA TOP 20 WORD & CARD GAME in the USA, Canada, UK, Australia, and many more countries, loved by players with 4.6 stars from 56,000+ ratings. Thank you!\n\nHOW TO PLAY\nHold the phone to your forehead. Everyone else sees the word, but you don't. They act it out, describe it, sing it, or dance it while you guess. Got it? Tilt your head down for a new word. Stuck? Tilt up to pass. Racing the clock too stressful? Turn the timer off and play at your own pace.\n\nMORE THAN GUESSING\nPick your challenge type: acting, dancing, singing, sketching, describing, and more. Every round is different: charades, drawing games, and karaoke chaos in one app.\n\nFEATURES\n• Game Center achievements & leaderboards: compete with friends and the world\n• Create your own decks, or let AI build a custom deck for you in seconds\n• Play with 2 players or a party of 100+\n• Play remotely over FaceTime\n• Record your gameplay and share the funniest moments\n• Timer on or off – you decide\n• Sounds & haptic feedback (vibration)\n• New and updated decks added regularly\n\n95+ DECKS, 5,500+ WORDS\nThe English edition offers 95+ decks with over 5,500 words and phrases. Headbands is fully localized into 8 languages (English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Polish, Czech, Slovak), each language with its own culturally adapted decks. Popular decks include:\n• Act It Out\n• Animals\n• Movie Characters\n• Songs from the 60s to the 00s\n• And lots more!\n\nSome decks are free; additional decks are available via in-app purchase.\n\nPERFECT FOR EVERY OCCASION\nFamily game night, birthday parties, road trips, sleepovers, holidays, team-building icebreakers, or a spontaneous round over FaceTime. No board, no cards to lose, no setup: one phone (or a video call) is all you need.\n\nIf you're looking for the best charades app, a heads-up style guessing game, or a party game for friends and family, near or far, download Headbands today and start guessing!\n\nPrivacy policy: http://headbands.app/privacyPolicy.html\nTerms of use: http://headbands.app/termsOfUse.html", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.6408199999999997231725501478649675846099853515625, "fileSizeBytes":"46938112", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":39106, "trackContentRating":"12+", "sellerUrl":"https://www.headbands.app", "languageCodesISO2A":["CS", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "PL", "SK", "ES"], "minimumOsVersion":"16", "bundleId":"david.kadlcek.GuessWho", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "trackCensoredName":"Headbands: Charades Party Game", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/headbands-charades-party-game/id1424246763?uo=4", "userRatingCount":39106}]
